<section class="relative min-h-[min(58vh,640px)] sm:min-h-[62vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1778844679/ChatGPT_Image_May_15_2026_04_59_43_PM_xyoiwi.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center" alt="" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/30 z-[1] pointer-events-none"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#030a16]/95 via-[#030a16]/78 to-[#030a16]/55" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/30 z-[1] pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]/92" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/30 z-[1] pointer-events-none"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">Building Product Transparency</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">Health Product Declaration <span class="text-eurogold-400">(HPD)</span></h1><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-4">HPD compliance services for building product manufacturers - transparent disclosure of product contents and health information by Eurocert Asia.</p><p class="text-white/80 text-xs md:text-sm max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-8">Health Product Declaration (HPD) is a globally recognised standard for transparent disclosure of building product contents, supporting healthier and sustainable building materials across global markets.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#030a16] bg-eurogold-400 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-eurogold-300 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-eurogold-400/20" href="/contact/">Get HPD Support <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white border border-white/15 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-white/5 transition-all" href="/contact/">Contact Eurocert Asia</a></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-12 items-start"><div class="space-y-6 min-w-0"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Understanding HPD</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">What is a Health Product <span class="text-euro-600">Declaration (HPD)?</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">A Health Product Declaration (HPD) is a standardised format used to disclose the contents of building products and associated health information. HPDs are widely used in the green building industry and support sustainable construction, environmentally responsible purchasing, and healthier building material selection.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Eurocert Asia supports organisations seeking HPD compliance and documentation for construction products, building materials, interior products, and industrial manufacturing sectors - helping improve product transparency and meet sustainability expectations across global markets.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-heart-pulse text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">HPD communicates</h4></div><ul class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Product ingredients</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Chemical content</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Material composition</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Associated health hazards</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Sustainability information</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Product transparency data</span></li></ul></div></div><div class="w-full min-w-0 lg:sticky lg:top-24 self-start"><figure class="w-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1784003242/hpd_oivpdc.png" class="w-full h-auto block" alt="Health Product Declaration (HPD) - transparent, standardized, third-party verified building product disclosure" width="1200" height="800" decoding="async"/></figure></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Our Services</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">HPD <span class="text-euro-600">Support</span></h2><p class="text-slate-500 mt-2 text-sm max-w-2xl mx-auto">HPD documentation and compliance support by Eurocert Asia. Eurocert Asia is affiliated with Eurocert S.A., Athens, Greece - a leading global independent third-party inspection, audit and certification body.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-flask text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Ingredient Identification</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Identify product ingredients and materials across formulations and supply chains.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-vial text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Chemical Inventory Review</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Review chemical inventory information and associated disclosure requirements.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-link text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Supply Chain Transparency</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Improve supply chain transparency and supplier material documentation.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-file-medical text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">HPD Documentation Preparation</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Prepare Health Product Declaration documentation in the required format.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-leaf text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Green Building Support</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Support green building certification requirements and sustainable project specifications.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-shield-heart text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-s