details class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-5 py-4 shadow-sm open:shadow-md open:border-euro-200 transition-all"><summary class="heading-font cursor-pointer list-none text-sm font-bold text-euro-600 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span>What is HPD?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down text-eurogold-500 text-xs transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-3">HPD stands for Health Product Declaration.</p></details><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-5 py-4 shadow-sm open:shadow-md open:border-euro-200 transition-all"><summary class="heading-font cursor-pointer list-none text-sm font-bold text-euro-600 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span>What is a Health Product Declaration?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down text-eurogold-500 text-xs transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-3">A Health Product Declaration is a standardised document used to disclose product ingredients and associated health information for building and industrial products.</p></details><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-5 py-4 shadow-sm open:shadow-md open:border-euro-200 transition-all"><summary class="heading-font cursor-pointer list-none text-sm font-bold text-euro-600 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span>Why is HPD important?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down text-eurogold-500 text-xs transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-3">HPD helps organisations improve product transparency, support sustainability initiatives, and meet green building project requirements.</p></de